ore use. Scentspired is not responsible for adverse reactions resulting from individual sensitivities.<br/><br/><strong>Section 15 – Indemnification</strong><br/><br/>You agree to indemnify and hold Scentspired USA harmless from any claims resulting from your breach of these Terms.<br/><br/><strong>Section 16 – Severability</strong><br/><br/>If any provision is deemed unenforceable, the remaining provisions shall remain in effect.<br/><br/><strong>Section 17 – Termination</strong><br/><br/>These Terms remain effective unless terminated by either party. We may terminate your access if you breach any part of these Terms.<br/><br/><strong>Section 18 – Entire Agreement<br/></strong><br/>These Terms constitute the entire agreement between you and us. No waiver or failure to enforce any provision shall be construed as a waiver of that provision.<br/><br/><strong>Section 19 – Governing Law</strong><br/><br/>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United States.<br/><br/><strong>Section 20 – Changes to Terms</strong><br/><br/>You can review the most current version of the Terms on this page. It is your responsibility to check this page periodically. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.<br/><br/><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Questions about the Terms of Service should be sent to: support@scentspired.com</p>"
